    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Enter a world of darkness and danger in Calmed by the Dark Shin Neon</strong></i><br>Calmed by the Dark Shin Neon is a Action-RPG set in a future where creatures, known as Biomorphics, live between humans. Being a danger to mankind, a organization of hunters was created to terminate them...<br><br>In this action-packed game, you'll take on the role of Tommy, a hunter tasked with protecting the city and stopping the Biomorphic threat. With a mission-based structure, you'll embark on thrilling missions to uncover the truth behind the Biomorphics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411920/extras/Steam_3.PNG?t=1724110753\" /></span><br>Either with melee or ranged attacks, test your skills as you want.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ACTION COMBAT</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411920/extras/Steak2.PNG?t=1724110753\" /></span><br>Refined 2.5D Action combat for satisfying gameplay.",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>Enter a world of darkness and danger in Calmed by the Dark Shin Neon</strong></i><br>Calmed by the Dark Shin Neon is a Action-RPG set in a future where creatures, known as Biomorphics, live between humans. Being a danger to mankind, a organization of hunters was created to terminate them...<br><br>In this action-packed game, you'll take on the role of Tommy, a hunter tasked with protecting the city and stopping the Biomorphic threat. With a mission-based structure, you'll embark on thrilling missions to uncover the truth behind the Biomorphics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411920/extras/Steam_3.PNG?t=1724110753\" /></span><br>Either with melee or ranged attacks, test your skills as you want.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ACTION COMBAT</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411920/extras/Steak2.PNG?t=1724110753\" /></span><br>Refined 2.5D Action combat for satisfying gameplay.",
